      "summaries": {
        "en": "wav2vec2-base-vi is a Vietnamese speech recognition model that converts spoken Vietnamese into text, addressing the need for accurate voice interfaces in Vietnam's digital ecosystem. It leverages self-supervised pretraining on 13,000 hours of YouTube audio, learning speech representations without extensive labeled data—a key insight for low-resource languages. Developers can fine-tune it for applications like voice assistants or transcription tools using Hugging Face's transformers library, enabling rapid deployment in real-world scenarios.",
        "zh": "wav2vec2-base-vi 是一个专门针对越南语的语音识别模型，能将越南语语音准确转换为文本，解决了越南语在智能设备交互中的技术空白。它采用自监督预训练技术，在1.3万小时YouTube音频数据上学习语音特征，无需大量标注数据就能捕捉语言规律——这对资源稀缺语言尤为关键。开发者可通过Hugging Face平台直接调用，微调后用于构建语音助手、会议转录等应用，为越南语数字服务提供核心技术支持。",
        "es": "wav2vec2-base-vi is a Vietnamese speech recognition model that converts spoken Vietnamese into text, addressing the need for accurate voice interfaces in Vietnam's digital ecosystem. It leverages self-supervised pretraining on 13,000 hours of YouTube audio, learning speech representations without extensive labeled data—a key insight for low-resource languages. Developers can fine-tune it for applications like voice assistants or transcription tools using Hugging Face's transformers library, enabling rapid deployment in real-world scenarios.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "wav2vec2-base-vi stands out for transformers, pytorch, and wav2vec2 in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "wav2vec2-base-vi is a Vietnamese speech recognition model that converts spoken Vietnamese into text, addressing the need for accurate voice interfaces in Vietnam's digital ecosystem. It leverages self-supervised pretraining on 13,000 hours of YouTube audio, learning speech representations without extensive labeled data—a key insight for low-resource languages. Developers can fine-tune it for applications like voice assistants or transcription tools using Hugging Face's transformers library, enabling rapid deployment in real-world scenarios.",
          "how": "Review https://huggingface.co/nguyenvulebinh/wav2vec2-base-vi for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
